	| Update Field New Value      | 7.2                           |
	And the history entry with the keyword "Test Test > Added License Key" with the field value "licenseEntryId" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Test Test > Added License Key |
	| Update Field Name           | licenseEntryId                |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                           |
	| Update Field New Value      | ${staticLicenseKeyId}         |
	And the history entry with the keyword "Test Test > Added License Key" with the field value "macAddresses" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
