	And the history entry with the keyword "Test Test > Added License Key" with the field value "active" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
	| Update Description          | Test Test > Added License Key |
	| Update Field Name           | active                        |
	| Update Field Original Value | N/A                           |
	| Update Field New Value      | true                          |
	And the history entry with the keyword "Test Test > Added License Key" with the field value "userName" should be visible on the account details page with the following values
